msgstr "Důvěřovat rychle Povolit/Zakázat"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:239
msgid "Enable Trust Swiftly"
msgstr "Aktivujte funkci Trust Swiftly"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:244
msgid "API Key"
msgstr "Klíč API"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:253
msgid "Base URL"
msgstr "Základní URL"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:256
msgid ""
"Enter in your Trust Swiftly site URL i.e https://example.trustswiftly.com"
msgstr ""
"Zadejte adresu URL svého webu Trust Swiftly, tj. https://example."
"trustswiftly.com"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:262
msgid "Verification Method"
msgstr "Metoda ověření"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:273
msgid "Verification Template"
msgstr "Ověřovací šablona"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:278
msgid ""
"Select a verification method defined such as ID and Selfie. A Verification "
"Template should be set on Trust Swiftly."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte definovanou metodu ověření, jako je ID a Selfie. Ověřovací šablona "
"by měla být nastavena na Trust Swiftly."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:284
msgid "When To Verify"
msgstr "Kdy ověřit"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:289
msgid "Select when customers should verify their identity."
msgstr "Vyberte, kdy mají zákazníci ověřit svou identitu."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:295
msgid "Select Threshold Weight"
msgstr "Vyberte prahovou hmotnost"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:300
msgid ""
"If the risk score exceed threshold value which is set here, then the "
"customer needs to be verified with Trust Swiftly."
msgstr ""
"Pokud skóre rizika překročí prahovou hodnotu, která je zde nastavena, je "
"třeba zákazníka ověřit pomocí Trust Swiftly."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:325
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:446
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:519
