#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:327
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:448
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:521
msgid ""
"<a href=\"https://maxmind.pxf.io/qnvxGg\" target=\"_blank\" >MaxMind "
"minFraud</a> is a paid, external service that uses machine learning to "
"detect potential fraud transactions. By using <a href=\"https://maxmind.pxf."
"io/qnvxGg\" target=\"_blank\" >minFraud</a> you can potentially detect more "
"fraudulent transactions.<br/>To sign up to MaxMind minFraud, click this "
"link: <a href=\"https://maxmind.pxf.io/qnvxGg\" target=\"_blank\">https://"
"maxmind.com</a><hr/>"
msgstr ""
"<a href=\"htts://maxmind.pxf.io/qnvxGg\" target=\"_blank\" >MaxMind "
"minFraud</a> je placená externí služba, která pomocí strojového učení "
"odhaluje potenciální podvodné transakce. Pomocí <a href=\"https://maxmind."
"pxf.io/qnvxGg\" target=\"_blank\" >minFraud</a> můžete potenciálně odhalit "
"další podvodné transakce.<br/>Chcete-li se zaregistrovat do MaxMind "
"minFraud, klikněte tento odkaz: <a href=\"https://maxmind.pxf.io/qnvxGg\" "
"target=\"_blank\">https://maxmind.com</a><hr/>"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:332
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:452
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:525
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:898
msgid "Enable/Disable"
msgstr "Povolit zakázat"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:335
msgid "Enable MaxMind minFraud Integration"
msgstr "Povolte integraci MaxMind minFraud"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:340
msgid "Device Tracking"
msgstr "Sledování zařízení"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:343
msgid ""
"Detect if a person uses the same device but changes proxies while they are "
"placing multiple orders from your website"
msgstr ""
"Zjistěte, zda osoba používá stejné zařízení, ale mění proxy, když zadává "
"více objednávek z vašeho webu"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:349
msgid "MaxMind Account ID"
msgstr "ID účtu MaxMind"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:351
msgid ""
"Enter your MaxMind account ID here.  If you don&apos;t have an account, "
"please sign up at <a href=\"https://maxmind.pxf.io/qnvxGg\" target=\"_blank"
"\">https://maxmind.com</a>."
msgstr ""
"Zde zadejte ID svého účtu MaxMind. Pokud účet nemáte, zaregistrujte se na "
"adrese <a href=\"https://maxmind.pxf.io/qnvxGg\" target=\"_blank\">https://"
"maxmind.com</a>."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:356
msgid "MaxMind License Key"
msgstr "Licenční klíč MaxMind"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:358
msgid "Enter the license key provided by MaxMind here."
msgstr "Zde zadejte licenční klíč poskytnutý společností MaxMind."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:364
msgid "Does IP Address Match Location?"
msgstr "Odpovídá adresa IP umístění?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:369
msgid ""
"Enable it to identify that customer's physical location matches the location "
"provided by IP address."
msgstr ""
"Povolte ji, aby bylo možné identifikovat fyzickou polohu zákazníka, která se "
"shoduje s polohou poskytnutou IP adresou."

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:373
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1398
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1437
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1469
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1493
#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:1515
