msgstr "Prahové skóre minFraud Factors Risk"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:560
msgid "minFraud Factors Rule Weight"
msgstr "MinFraud Factors Rule Weight"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:592
msgid "Support for the Anti-Fraud Plugin"
msgstr "Podpora pro Anti-Fraud Plugin"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:598
