"If you have any issues or feedback about Anti-Fraud plugin, we would love to "
"here from you!"
msgstr ""
"Máte-li jakékoli problémy nebo zpětnou vazbu ohledně pluginu Anti-Fraud, "
"rádi je zde od vás!"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:607
msgid "Love our Plugin?"
msgstr "Líbí se vám náš plugin?"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:609
msgid "Leave Us a Review!"
msgstr "Napište nám recenzi!"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:611
